mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>A</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:
10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Потом
подошёл к
стене и одел
пальто.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">          
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>A</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>И вышел
туда, где
снег и ночь,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">            
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>A</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Hm</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>И сел в
трамвай -
уехать прочь,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>A</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Туда, где
есть<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:gray'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:#333333;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>A</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">               </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:#333333'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Десять
прекрасных
дам.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Хозяйка,
зевнув, ему
подала
ладонь,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Сказала:
"Ещё
когда-нибудь
зайдите на
наш огонь".<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>А гости
сидели за
столом<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>И чинно
сосали чай с
дерьмом,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>И пили за <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Здоровье
прекрасных
дам.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>И он вышел
прочь - куда,
он не знал и
сам.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Набрав
семь цифр, он
мёрз,
подпевая
гудкам.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Но трубок
никто не
поднимал,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
